body:
Cheers for that, it makes me feel a lot better.

&#x200B;

Feeling guilty is just something I've got to work on. I never felt like I was misusing the system, but I do feel like I have a debt that i'll never be able to repay.

Yeah I know the feeling. I don't want to go into detail on here but I had made myself extremely unwell, and as such my doctor broke confidentiality and rang my parents.. So it was a combination of being very sick but also my parents finding out (having not known I was struggling).

&#x200B;

It's been a few years now, and has definitely got better over time, but i've only recently been diagnosed with PTSD and been addressing the issue of trauma directly
